        "sectionLabel": "Synthetic test record",
        "scope": "abstract",
        "text": "[SYNTHETIC TEST RECORD ONLY] Overall, 22 participants and 88 pulmonary veins were studied. Group Alpha enrolled 9 participants and studied 36 pulmonary veins; Group Beta enrolled 13 participants and studied 52 pulmonary veins. These are reported group counts, not result denominators. Group Alpha had median procedural duration 48 minutes; Group Beta had median procedural duration 26 minutes. The source explicitly compared these two medians. Group Alpha success was 78.4 percent at 12 months after the procedure; the numerator and assessed denominator were not reported. A mapping stage before ablation was described for Group Alpha."
      }
    ]
  },
